{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51611","headline":"莫思归（即《抛球乐》） · 冯延巳","name":"莫思归（即《抛球乐》）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花满名园酒满觞，且开笑口对穠芳。\n秋千风暖鸾钗嚲，绮陌春深翠袖香。\n莫惜黄金贵，日日须教贳酒尝。\n（《花草粹编》一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51611.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51611","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}